  "reason": "The existing evidence shows config_001 (multimodal, multiprofile, scvi_n200, imagenet_vit_l, transformer, weighted) achieves 0.7249 validation accuracy. Config_046 tests a similar setup but with pca_n2000 RNA encoder and concat fusion, which could reveal if these changes improve accuracy. This experiment clarifies whether the RNA encoder or fusion method is more critical. It balances exploitation (similar architecture to top performer) with exploration (different components). Expected cost: ~4.5 GPU hours, which is affordable and aligns with prior experiments using transformer aggregation."
